			100, 50, 1.0, 0, 0, 4, -2, true);

		assertEquals(0.0, result.getAverageSuccessfulHit(), 0.0000001);
		assertEquals(0.0, result.getDamagePerSecond(), 0.0000001);
	}

	@Test
	public void mapsTargetDefenceToTheSelectedAttackType()
	{
